# Audio

Explicit listen — tap to play. One `<audio>` element; `play()` inside the tap gesture only. Resume positions per drawing.

m4a masters (LFS). Encode bakes needle drop/lift/overlap into `*.vinyl.m4a` / `.webm`. Player plays that file; `pickAudioSrc()` at runtime. No runtime vinyl clocks.

Safari / Chrome / Firefox: native `<audio>` + Web Audio + gesture unlock. Service worker is an enhancement, not required for playback.
